1
00:00:00,012 --> 00:00:07,477
Test case 106. An item added to the cart stays in the cart after sorting Z to A.

2
00:00:08,515 --> 00:00:13,205
We start on the Products page, sorted Name A to Z.

3
00:00:13,237 --> 00:00:18,292
Step 1. Add the Sauce Labs Backpack to the cart.

4
00:00:18,473 --> 00:00:23,148
The button now says Remove, and the cart badge shows 1.

5
00:00:23,156 --> 00:00:29,391
Step 2. Choose Name, Z to A, in the sort dropdown.

6
00:00:29,462 --> 00:00:37,617
Step 3. Check the order. The Red T-Shirt is now first, and the Backpack is last.

7
00:00:37,677 --> 00:00:45,632
The Backpack still says Remove, and the cart badge still shows 1. Sorting did not change the cart.

8
00:00:45,650 --> 00:00:50,140
Result: test case 106 passes.
